<title>UK: RESEARCH ALERT-Douglas raised at Goldman.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT-Douglas raised at Goldman.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>German speciality retailer Douglas Holding AG was raised to &quot;market performer&quot; from &quot;market underperformer&quot; by Goldman Sachs, the investment bank said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>Further detail was not immediately available.</p>
<p>-- David Holmes, London Newsroom +44 171 542 4367</p>
</text>
